    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Arcade Rhythm Game Legend\u2014Now at Your Fingertips</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300ePUMP IT UP R!SE\u300f is the official PC adaptation of the beloved \u300ePUMP IT UP\u300f series, which has captivated the arcade rhythm game scene for over 25 years.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its iconic step-based gameplay has been fully reimagined and optimized for hand controls\u2014whether you use a keyboard, gamepad, or Steam Deck.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A redesigned difficulty system ensures players of all skill levels, from newcomers to rhythm game veterans, can enjoy the game at their own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Rebuilt Step Charts and Multi-Input Support</strong> \u2013 All step charts have been newly crafted for hand input. From 5-key \u201cSingle\u201d to 6-key \u201cHalf Double,\u201d each layout is carefully optimized to retain the signature impact and rhythm of the original arcade version.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Three Game Modes (Stations)</strong> \u2013 WARM UP: Practice freely with no pressure, access all tracks anytime. DIVISION: Compete with players of similar skill in a ranked mode. CHALLENGE: Take on a 10-tier skill test designed to measure and push your limits.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>200+ Tracks Included, with Expanding Content</strong> \u2013 Over 200 songs are available at launch, including iconic series tracks like \u201cBeethoven Virus,\u201d \u201cTurkish March,\u201d and \u201cCanon D,\u201d along with original songs from the latest versions. New songs will be added through regular updates, with seasonal DLC planned to grow the total tracklist to over 400.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Steam Deck Support and System Optimization</strong> \u2013 Developed with Steam Deck compatibility in mind from day one, \u300ePUMP IT UP R!SE\u300f delivers a smooth and responsive experience across a wide range of input devices, including keyboard and gamepad.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Arcade Rhythm Game Legend\u2014Now at Your Fingertips</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300ePUMP IT UP R!SE\u300f is the official PC adaptation of the beloved \u300ePUMP IT UP\u300f series, which has captivated the arcade rhythm game scene for over 25 years.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its iconic step-based gameplay has been fully reimagined and optimized for hand controls\u2014whether you use a keyboard, gamepad, or Steam Deck.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A redesigned difficulty system ensures players of all skill levels, from newcomers to rhythm game veterans, can enjoy the game at their own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Rebuilt Step Charts and Multi-Input Support</strong> \u2013 All step charts have been newly crafted for hand input. From 5-key \u201cSingle\u201d to 6-key \u201cHalf Double,\u201d each layout is carefully optimized to retain the signature impact and rhythm of the original arcade version.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Three Game Modes (Stations)</strong> \u2013 WARM UP: Practice freely with no pressure, access all tracks anytime. DIVISION: Compete with players of similar skill in a ranked mode. CHALLENGE: Take on a 10-tier skill test designed to measure and push your limits.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>200+ Tracks Included, with Expanding Content</strong> \u2013 Over 200 songs are available at launch, including iconic series tracks like \u201cBeethoven Virus,\u201d \u201cTurkish March,\u201d and \u201cCanon D,\u201d along with original songs from the latest versions. New songs will be added through regular updates, with seasonal DLC planned to grow the total tracklist to over 400.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Steam Deck Support and System Optimization</strong> \u2013 Developed with Steam Deck compatibility in mind from day one, \u300ePUMP IT UP R!SE\u300f delivers a smooth and responsive experience across a wide range of input devices, including keyboard and gamepad.</li></ul>",
